## Repo map

Read before exploring; update in the commit changing a folder, domain or entry point.

{% if backend == 'django' -%}
- `{{ bp }}config/`: settings (`settings.py`), URLs (`urls.py`), Ninja API (`api.py`),
  middlewares, health probes (`health.py`), admin commands (`management/`).
- `{{ bp }}<app>/`: one Django app per business domain; `{{ bp }}tests/`: cross-cutting tests.
{% elif backend == 'fastapi' -%}
- `{{ bp }}app/`: entry point (`main.py`), settings (`settings.py`), health probes
  (`health.py`); one module per domain. `{{ bp }}tests/`: tests.
{% elif backend == 'data' -%}
- `{{ bp }}pipeline/`: loading (`sources.py`), transformations (`transforms.py`), figures
  (`figures.py`); `{{ bp }}notebooks/`: marimo notebooks; `{{ bp }}data/`: data (`sample/` is
  committed). `{{ bp }}tests/`: tests.
{% elif backend == 'cli' -%}
- `{{ bp }}{{ name | replace('-', '_') }}/`: commands (`cli.py`, entry point `__main__.py`) and
  business logic; `{{ bp }}tests/`: tests.
{% elif backend == 'java' -%}
- `{{ bp }}src/main/java/{{ java_package | replace('.', '/') }}/`: entry point (`Main.java`), one
  package per domain; `{{ bp }}src/test/java/`: JUnit tests; `{{ bp }}pom.xml`: Maven build.
{% endif -%}
{% if frontend == 'nuxt' -%}
- `{{ fp }}app/`: pages, components (`components/`), composables, styles (`assets/`),
  constants (`app/utils/constants.ts`){% if backend == 'django' %}, API types generated in
  `app/types/api.d.ts`{% endif %}.
{% elif frontend == 'next' -%}
- `{{ fp }}app/`: routes (App Router); `{{ fp }}components/`: components; `{{ fp }}lib/`:
  API client and constants (`constants.ts`).
{% elif frontend == 'astro' -%}
- `{{ fp }}src/`: pages (`pages/`), layouts (`layouts/`), styles, constants (`constants.ts`).
{% elif frontend == 'vite-react' -%}
- `{{ fp }}src/`: the app (`App.tsx`, entry `main.tsx`), API client (`lib/`), constants
  (`constants.ts`); `{{ fp }}index.html`: the page Vite serves.
{% elif frontend in ['streamlit', 'dash'] -%}
- `{{ fp }}app.py`: entry point; `{{ fp }}dashboard/`: pages, layout and constants;
  `{{ fp }}tests/`: tests.
{% endif -%}
{% if deploy == 'vps' -%}
- `config/vps/`, `scripts/ops/`: deployment and operations; how-to in
  [`docs/operations/production.md`](docs/operations/production.md).
{% endif -%}
- `docs/backlog/`; `charter.toml`; `.claude/rules/ion-repo/`.

